<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia's shipping line appoints executive.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia's shipping line appoints executive.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian government-owned shipping line ANL Ltd said on Friday it had appointed John Lines as chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Executive chairman Ted Anson said in a statement Lines would oversee ANL's bulk and land-based businesses in addition to his previous role of directing the liner shipping operations.</p>
<p>-- Canberra Bureau 61-6 273-2730</p>
</text>
